  "machineSetting": "machine",
  "_machines_note": "ONE core.wbx, a machine per system Mesen emulates; the setting 'machine' picks one. The NES is the first and the default, so a project made before the other machines existed is an NES project; it keeps the package's top-level controller, picture and settings, which are the NES's. Each other machine has its own controller and picture size; their settings say which machines they belong to ('when').",
